%% StreamingUtteranceSegmenter: one transition per 20 ms frame.
stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> IDLE
    IDLE --> IDLE: silence · keep frame in pre-roll
    IDLE --> SPEECH: N consecutive speech frames<br/>(prepend pre-roll)
    SPEECH --> ENDING: silence frame
    ENDING --> SPEECH: speech frame
    SPEECH --> CLOSE: max duration · flush()
    ENDING --> CLOSE: end silence · max duration · flush()
    CLOSE --> IDLE: emit if speech ≥ min_speech_ms<br/>else discard
    state CLOSE <<choice>>
